  "description": "Millers Glen is a vibrant new community in Swords, Co. Dublin that offers modern convenience in a well-connected location. Situated just minutes from Swords Town Centre, residents will enjoy easy access to a wide range of amenities, including schools, parks, shopping, leisure facilities and sports clubs. With excellent transport links and a wealth of local attractions nearby, Millers Glen offers an ideal setting for everyone.\n\nMost homes in this exciting new development are expected to be available from early December 2026, with the remaining four one-bedroom units anticipated to become available in late January 2027.\n\nAll CGI visuals, images and technical descriptions are provided for illustrative purposes only and reflect the current design intent. Final installations, equipment specifications, layouts and site finishes may vary during the construction process. \n\nA deposit is required upfront to secure tenancy. Applicants are encouraged to upload all correct supporting documentation at the point of submission.\n\nApplications close on Thursday, 8 October 2026.",
  "features": [
    "Maintenance-free exteriors with a tasteful mix of brick and/or render.",
    "PVC fascia, gutters and downpipes.",
    "Composite front doors with a secure locking system.",
    "Walls and ceilings painted in Fleetwood Vinyl Matt throughout, with quality interior joinery including painted doors and contemporary skirting and architraves finished in an off-white.",
    "Superb modern kitchens with ergonomic design, soft-close doors, durable hardwearing worktops, full hob backsplash and matching upstand.",
    "Generous lighting, power points and switches throughout.",
    "Smoke and heat detectors fitted as standard, with TV connections in the living room, kitchen and master bedroom.",
    "Condensing heat pump heating system, thermostatically controlled to maximise comfort, with provision for the installation of a car charging point.",
    "Stylish contemporary bathroom, ensuite and guest WC with elegant sanitary ware, beautiful taps, shower heads and bath fittings.",
    "20 car parking spaces associated with the block, plus a bike store and bin store."
  ],
